IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `gas-offences`

-- Gas Act 2001, ss 6, 11-13, 30-32B, 47, 50, 52, 64, 89, 91, 92 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_gas-act-2001.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

